OL,3,GNEWSAProceeds of crime action against
OL,4,Aformer SNP chief Murrell delayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDisgraced former SNP chief executive
OL,7,FPeter Murrell will return to court
OL,8,Flater this year after his proceeds of
OL,9,Fcrime hearing was delayed.
OL,11,FThe 61-year-old is currently serving
OL,12,Fmore than five years in HMP Dumfries
OL,13,Ffor stealing more than #400,000 from
OL,14,Fthe SNP.
OL,16,FMurrell - the estranged husband of
OL,17,FNicola Sturgeon - was due to appear at
OL,18,Fthe High Court in Edinburgh on Monday
OL,19,Ffor Crown lawyers to attempt to recover
OL,20,Fthe money he embezzled.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
