OL,3,GNEWSAProceeds of crime action against
OL,4,Aformer SNP chief Murrell delayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever the Scottish Courts and
OL,7,FTribunals Service confirmed a judge had
OL,8,Fagreed to postpone the hearing until 7
OL,9,FDecember, after both sides asked for it
OL,10,Fto be adjourned.
